    "howToPlayCrewmate": {
        "0": "<color=#8CFFFFFF>Crewmate</color>\n As a Crewmate, your objective goal is to complete all tasks and exile the ",
        "13": "<color=#8CFFFFFF>船员职业</color>\n 作为一名船员，你的任务是找出藏在你们之中的内鬼和中立并完成任务\n 当然你也要运用好你的特殊技能帮助你完成这一目标"
    },
    "howToPlayImpostor": {
        "0": "<color=#FF1919FF>Impostors</color>\n You might also use your special abilities to discover all hidden ",
        "13": "<color=#FF1919FF>内鬼职业</color>\n 杀光船员和中立，并对飞船搞破坏切记要阻止船员完成任务\n 运用好你的特殊技能让船员们不知所措吧! "
    },
    "howToPlayNeutral": {
        "0": "<color=#4C544EFF>Neutrals</color>\n For some individuals, your power is hidden until a certain amount of tasks have been completed \n Use your abilities wisely and uncover the evil powers that are among you",
        "13": "<color=#4C544EFF>中立职业</color>\n 你不属于船员和内鬼而是自我独立的阵营\n 最重要的是你需要用好你的技能帮助你获胜 "
    },
    "howToPlayModifier": {
        "0": "<color=#FFFF33>Modifier</color>\n This is a modifier you've got—you need to make good use of it to contribute to the victory.",
        "13": "<color=#FFFF33>附加职业</color>\n 这是你额外获得的技能，你需要利用好这项技能为胜利做出努力"
